Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你毁了我的人生  奥莉薇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruined my life, Olivette.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说  这才叫伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poetic justice, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Styne family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,自我挖出了《诅咒之书》他们就一直在追踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been after me since I-I dug up "The Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the spells they used
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都来自一本"极邪恶之书"\N{\fnArial\fs30}came from a book of "Unspeakable evil."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家族永远不会停止寻找那本书的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family will never stop looking for that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要想办法去掉迪恩的该隐血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to figure a way to get the Mark of Cain off Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,免得他再变回恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it turns him back into a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那本书里的确有祛除血印的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a cure for the mark in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it comes at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也许背着他做这些不是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe going behind his back ain't the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  烧了它  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Burn it -- now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这份生活就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know it's the life --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,做点坏事  才能做更多好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing a little bad so you can do a lot of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.86,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但有时坏事非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes the bad's real bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而好事  要付出相当大的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the good -- it can come at one hell of a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我替你杀了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你能读懂这本书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,把娜迪娅的法典拿来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me Nadya's codex,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就能把破咒办法告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll give you your cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们达成了协议的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想出去吗  快点干活儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want out? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(内布拉斯加州  奥马哈)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是艾琳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Eileen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.05,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我来面试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm here for the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能下班后见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for fitting me in after hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以看到  我身体健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}As, um, as you can see, I'm in good health
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,视力良好  这很重要  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my eyesight is 20/20, which is important, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是视力方面的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is a research study on eyesight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-my friends and I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都尽可能参与这些临床研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}do as many of these clinical studies as we can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们都很穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're all on budgets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这种项目挣钱不少  可以付学费\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the money from these things really helps with college.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything seems to be in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你的眼睛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a peek at these eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,里面没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都没破解出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗威娜  这都多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena, it's been days!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你说法典能顺利破解密文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the codex would crack the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个艺术家  萨穆埃尔  这种事催不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am an artist, Samuel. These things cannot be rushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不是被铐着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if I weren't chained up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不是最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你休想达到最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you won't be at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不许施巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}No witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要从书中找到治好我哥哥的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I need the cure for my brother from the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你在有意拖延\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you're stalling...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要拖延啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why on earth would I stall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护我自己  我也想祛除你哥哥的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the mark off your brother for my own protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想摆脱这镣铐  离开这破地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want out of these chains and out of this pit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我还希望你能遵守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to hold up your end of the deal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得我们的协议吧  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember the deal, do you not, Samuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  我毫不介意杀了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I have no issue killing Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,娜迪娅在法典中用的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}the language Nadya used in the codex
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎无法破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}is damn near indecipherable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她法术高强  但也十分自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a gifted witch but a selfish pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她破解了一种密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once she cracked a code,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.91,0:04:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,便又以自己的方式进行了编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}she then coded its secrets for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们要破译密文  还要先破译密文吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need to break a code to...break a code?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  迪恩的情况每况愈下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dean gets worse every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会忘记买东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't forget the grocery shopping, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(路易斯安那州  什里夫波特)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,令人震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,令人震惊又令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astounding and disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔登\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time, Eldon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾认为你是最有前途的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I would call you our most promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去问问你的兄弟和堂表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask your brothers and your cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但你显然是被宠坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But clearly, you have been spoiled and overindulged,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,导致了如此自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the result is arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The utter lack of judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你采集器官前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you'd take time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a little quickie with that girl
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,温存一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you harvested her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-先生  -你被人看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir... - And you were discovered by a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不留目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have witnesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也不留下尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And left a body behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,采集器官时更不能留下尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we certainly don't leave behind bodies when we harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这么多世纪来得以成功的秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole key to our success all these centuries
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}is secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未做过这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never done anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布死后  我一直不在状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been myself... ever since Jacob died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不许你玷污你哥哥的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare cheapen the memory of your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,拿他当做自己愚蠢的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}by using him as an excuse for your foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我十分后悔  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm filled with regret, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.09,0:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但你会诚心后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你失去家族内的地位的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are cast down to the lower echelons of this family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,被剥夺儿子和继承人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you will exchange your title of son and heir
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,变成小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}for lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就犯了这么一个错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made this single mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是维持我们共同生活的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is all that holds our life together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.11,0:06:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有规矩  我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it unravels, we are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你要这样赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's how you'll redeem yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  收拾好奥马哈的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, clean up your mess in Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,然后  去找到这对温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, you will track down these Winchesters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了你哥哥雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}who murdered your brother Jacob,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且现在  他们可能还拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who may now have in their possession
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,, 《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Book of the Damned".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,门罗叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Monroe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  伊莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Eli?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.81,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想  这样是否合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if it was best
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让埃尔登处理如此重大的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put such an important assignment in Eldon's hands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}since his...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他的判断力如此有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}judgment is so questionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆子不小啊  伊莱  你自己也有问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very bold of you, Eli, considering your own issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么问题  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My issues, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那个神秘的红发女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mysterious redheaded girl
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你堂兄雅各布死前在追查的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your cousin Jacob was tracking when he died...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,偷走了书的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that stole the book...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她的职责不是交给你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was that task not passed on to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you located her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no trace of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果书不在温家兄弟那里  就是在她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if the Winchesters don't have the book, she's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真这么担心你堂弟会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're so worried that your cousin will fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那就跟埃尔登汇报情况  帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}report in with Eldon and back his effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你气色好差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look like crap on toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我没怎么睡好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just haven't... really been sleeping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是秘密结识了女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman you haven't mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-女人  -我就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A woman? - Well, I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚去睡的时候  你不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't here when I went to bed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这几周经常一个人跑出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been running off on your own a lot these past couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有时就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  我们又不是时刻同步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we don't always do the exact same thing at the exact same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了你还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when you went off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,自己跑去消灭了一窝吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and snuffed that vampire nest by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是去剿灭吸血鬼巢穴了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been snuffing vamps' nests?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  你这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,之前那些来找书的二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, those goons that were after the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}the, uh, the Stynes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,被杀的那个  说过自己有庞大的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, the one that we killed said that he had a big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以如果他们家还有别人  我就想我们该\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if there's more out there, I figure we should probably
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,尽可能多了解一下他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}get to know as much as we can about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.39,0:09:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就我们已经知道的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's pretty much what we do know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们操纵金融市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they screwed with financial markets,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助希特勒起家\N{\fnArial\fs30}they helped Hitler get started,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道还有什么  或许迪斯科吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with god knows what else... probably disco.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但追溯到19世纪  就查不到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you go back to the 1800s, and the trail goes dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,资料里没有  网上也找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in the research, there's nothing online.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,简直像他们家族有天从石头缝里蹦出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the family just popped up one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,家族一般不会这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Families don't usually do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也不完全是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been a total waste of time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我可能发现了桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I caught us a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,网上有一起奥马哈的凶杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a mention online of a murder in Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,被害人眼睛被挖出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victim's eyes were cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,清洁工跑进去  正好看到凶手从窗户跳下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janitor runs in just as the killer jumps out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-就这样吗  -三楼窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - Well, the window was on the third story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想找点事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I'm just trying to stay busy here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你有更要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you have bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I'm sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'm gonna hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该睡会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明天一早就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave first thing in the a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然开着老旧的小轿车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, in a...beat-up, prehistoric subcompact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么在这里见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why are we meeting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以去死星的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've come to the death star.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, this is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这样其实更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is better, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们反正也不在地堡里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna be working in the bunker, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么事来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this about, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你没怎么说明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were kind of...vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的  迪恩的情况并没好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, here's the thing... Dean is not getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们如果不祛除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like if we don't get the mark off his arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他会被吞噬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna eat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这我明白  但我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, but what are we gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了一本法典  算是超自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got ahold of a codex which is sort of a-a collection
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,译码工具全集吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of supernatural code-breaking tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,应该能用来破译《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it should help crack "The Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只是书已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the book, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没被毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我假装烧掉之前把书掉包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swapped it out right before it looked like I burned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  迪恩是想烧掉的  那他生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, Dean wanted it burned, so is he pissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了  他还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez! The two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,查理  他不在状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, he's not himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的  他会阻止我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not. He would try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我请了一位专家  用法典进行破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I called in an expert to... to use the codex,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但法典也是加了密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it turns out it's sort of...encoded also,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想让你帮忙  加速进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I thought you might help... move things along faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,背着迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind Dean's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而迪恩已经警告我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Dean told us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如果瞎鼓捣  会被书整惨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stupid book would kick our asses if we mess with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面有一点没问题的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- is there any part of this that doesn't reek?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我有没有提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention you'll be working
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟世上最危险的女巫之一合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of the most dangerous witches in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不好吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就我所知  这是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can tell, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,救他的唯一机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our only shot at saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他就没救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说得很清楚吗  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was clear, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的是更多时间  不是助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I requested more time, not an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不也说得很清楚吗  罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought I was clear, Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,查理不是你的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie is not your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是她的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪学的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you studied your craft where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是在一个叫马斯爪哇的馆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly a joint called mas java.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,无线信号特别好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has excellent wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未听过那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not heard of this institution,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而且全球各处的巫术中心我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know all the great global centers of witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也有道理  我不是女巫嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense, 'cause I'm not a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是技术宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,技术宅的聚集地我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know all the great centers of nerddom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,罗威娜  地盘标记完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena, are you done marking your turf?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:12:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  查理有技术手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Charlie has tech chops
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,能加速娜迪娅法典的破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll speed up cracking Nadya's codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你辨识出古咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will spot the ancient curses and spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.71,0:13:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把这堆乱码变成明文\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that'll put this whole mess in context.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in on this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,又来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More distractions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,女巫还是技术宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch or nerd?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥  有法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel has, uh, powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用神力保护你们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spiritual muscle that'll help safeguard the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,防备什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safeguard it from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能一直待在这里做仲裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be here full time to referee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我这个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我要仲裁  我至少该清楚规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm gonna referee, I should at least know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是一根筋啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite literal, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道首要规则是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know that the first rule
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉你哥哥我们在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is don't tell your brother what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean doesn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  这事不会有好果子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this never ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everyone take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在局面很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're up against it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都经历过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've all been up against it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道有时候所有的选择都很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know there are times when every choice sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们瞒着迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, us...lying to Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是糟糕程度最低的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the choice that sucks the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他不熟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely know the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,希望是要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩得正嗨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a perfect game going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了一个问题  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-t-there's a problem, majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望你们这群蠢货能给我带来一次好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for once, I wish you trolls would bring me some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下  密苏里州生疖子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sire, Missouri has boils."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让人开心的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是陛下的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your majesty's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh-- uh, s-she's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听过杀死信使这一说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard of killing the messenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我母亲的消息别回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come back without news of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,组合好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice grouping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,警察告诉我不得任何人入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police told me no one was allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但联调局不包含在内  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't mean the FBI, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:15:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,清洁工是在人被杀之后马上赶来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the janitor came in right after the killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  他听到了尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he heard screaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是她眼球被挖出时发出的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when her eyeballs were scooped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,清洁工看到他跳下了窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janitor saw a man jump out the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跑进了小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}run down the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,跳下三层楼后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After, uh... falling three stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-有监控录像吗  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Security footage? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但只有一个摄像头拍到东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but just one of them caught any action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在巷子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是租下办公室的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy who rented the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼跳下来还挺悠然啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty slick for a three-story drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  能重放一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Can you, uh, play it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,停住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, freeze there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,跟斯戴恩家族的纹身一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same ink as the Stynes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他租下这里多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was he renting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但我只见过他一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I only saw him a day or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是在进行临床试验  招募学生志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of clinical trial using student volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说到要用眼球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't mention eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你今后恐怕要多问一句了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess you're gonna ask about that from now on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(卡西迪奥来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果再记起来什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you, uh, remember anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,电话推销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telemarketer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你话挺多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite the chatty patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他俩说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you tell those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么  我没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I-I've got nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,(无匹配)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你那个神奇的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That miraculous machine of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还没破解一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hasn't solved everything by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是中看不中用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overrated, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我在利用电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm using the computer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,分析书加密的规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find some pattern in the book's coding
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,或者与娜迪娅法典是否有相近之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any synchronicity with the symbols in Nadya's codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我比较传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more old-school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我解读自然向我展示的预示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read the signs nature shows me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在有人之前  那些力量曾掌控世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}the forces that ruled before there was man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么没想到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去你俩血糖都降低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it sounds like blood sugar is dipping in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我做人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was human,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢这些猪皮脆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew very fond of these pork rinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解写下《诅咒之书》的那个女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about the chick who wrote "The Book of the Damned"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝是位隐居的修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes was a hermit nun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,十分疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as mad as a hatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一心想破解咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made it her business to undo curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就像留下该隐血印的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the one that caused the Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,与所有正邪较量一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in any struggle between good and evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,必须达到平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}balance is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为破解一个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cure one curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝要知道如何施另一个咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes had to know how to inflict another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这两者在魔法世界是共存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They live side-by-side in the magic world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,相互依存\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cannot be without the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  就像二元系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sure. Like, uh, a binary system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我得按照隐士的方式思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I got to think like a hermit nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过她被人活活烧死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention they burned her alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.39,0:19:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她弄了一堆咒语  又看到撒旦预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cornucopia of curses and satanic visions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,教会当然会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}did not go unnoticed by the church hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们绝不会轻饶不守规矩的修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men would not abide a rogue nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的艾格尼丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,超前于时代啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahead of her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much like you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不觉得我们很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually don't...see our similarities all that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为善良年轻  而我老迈邪恶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're young and good and I'm ancient and evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说说你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,童年艰辛孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}A difficult and lonely childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,十分凄惨  父母不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragedy, absent parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,总不入流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always outside the mainstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,性方面很主动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sexually progressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,生活在自己的小世界里  寻求清净和人生方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living in your own head for solace and direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但我们还是很不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but still, we are pretty different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我一看见你就看透了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read you the minute I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你也渐渐知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure you're learning
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,正邪的分界线是很模糊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the line between good and evil is quite flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但盲目的忠诚是我们的最大区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we part company when it comes to blind devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比如  温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case in point... the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他们当做了你缺失的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made them the family you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:20:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩就像我哥哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean are like my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这份坚定的忠诚会害了你  姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that steadfast loyalty will be your undoing, my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族为什么要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why would the Stynes be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,挖眼杀人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually up to the eyeballs in murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉一个斯戴恩  千千万万个蹦出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you take a few Stynes down, more pop up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天知道他们有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说  我很庆幸我们烧毁了书\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can say is, I'm glad we burned that damn book.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,至少他们休想拿到那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they can't get their mitts on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢  你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what about you? How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那个事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有些黑暗的念头  可怕的幻视  暴力的冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, some dark thoughts, creepy visions, violent urges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.65,0:21:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,跟往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好有桩案子可以关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy I got a murder to focus on, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(卡西迪奥来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不  是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.03,0:22:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么事  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是想...保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just, uh... Just staying in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向如此啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.97,0:22:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有心事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.99,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这通电话毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}This call is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的车到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ride's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱都空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fridge is picked clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你去买  我掏钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn to fly. I buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, that's mine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近跟小卡有联络吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, you talk to... talk to Cass recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊  好一阵没联络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Um, not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.56,0:23:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不知道他干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定有事在做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got to be up to something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.97,0:23:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,天使的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel stuff or...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我要披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I vote for pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  罗威娜是很麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Rowena is a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  在床上放蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mercy. Snakes in the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那的确会让我发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would set my teeth on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我有床\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I owned a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,或是睡觉的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or slept...ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她不讨喜  她可恶极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's unpleasant. She's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,工作的地方还乱七八糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a messy workstation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么内幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the dirt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:24:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定还有什么我不知道的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be something that I don't know about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我用作筹码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}something I could hold over her as a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一个恶魔情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.04,0:24:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不用说得那么详细\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to paint a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.01,0:24:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,给我来个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a minion!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把地球都翻遍了  陛下  昼夜不歇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are scouring the planet, sire, a-around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.09,0:24:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不找到您母亲  我们绝不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not rest until your mother is found.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.69,0:24:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should say you aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我另有任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have another mission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的  陛下  -马上给我找到此人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sire. - Locate this person -- immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.19,0:24:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不管花什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.76,0:24:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,失败  就等着无尽的折磨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fail on pain of infinite pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.07,0:24:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,马上去办  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.87,0:24:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还愣着干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:24:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,身边尽是庸才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by mediocrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.58,0:25:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我还这么坚挺真是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a wonder I stay so buoyant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(24小时披萨外卖)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.41,0:25:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  别过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了  站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "hold it."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.81,0:26:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽全力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但她在旁边挖苦我  监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with her criticizing, breathing down my neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.54,0:26:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还企图拉拢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to sign me up for team witch --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哀叹1723年的音乐才是好音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and moaning how the one good year for music was 1723 --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.28,0:26:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抓狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I am going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.57,0:26:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -不  她是个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - No, I mean, she is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.45,0:26:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是邪恶女巫嘛  所以说起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a wicked witch, so by definition --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.34,0:26:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}something bad is gonna happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.64,0:26:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥  把我带去别的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, man, just spring me for two hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.98,0:26:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一两小时就行  安静的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}one hour -- anyplace quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.17,0:26:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩是我朋友  我不能搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean is my buddy, and I cannot screw this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.07,0:26:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的脑子  就像装满了毛虫糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but -- but my mind is -- is -- it's a wad of gummy worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.21,0:27:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.87,0:27:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是挺厉害  我看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong. I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但你也是人  会流血  会疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can bleed and hurt just like the next guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.31,0:27:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我来问  你要答\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna ask questions, you're gonna give answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.48,0:27:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不然很快就会很不好看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or it's gonna get crazy real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.15,0:27:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那但愿你有充足的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope you got some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是普通的小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the usual breed of cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.57,0:27:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.92,0:27:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是你杀了奥马哈的那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill that girl in Omaha?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么是真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.74,0:27:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你有该隐血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.98,0:27:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,深表同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才想要那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you wanted the book --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.79,0:27:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把血印去掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想要书\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted the book
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为那是你们的力量之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that's where your power comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.13,0:27:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, our family business
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.04,0:27:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就是让你们这种人衰败陷落\N{\fnArial\fs30}is putting guys like you out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人钦佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:28:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我来说说我们的家族事业吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you about my family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们根本无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in way over your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家族庞大无比  遍布全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family is vast -- spread over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你提到的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that power that you mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,并不源自那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't come from the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.07,0:28:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而是源自人的智慧和意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes from intelligence and will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,书只起到辅助作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book facilitates.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,股市跳水  大萧条  911事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stock market dive, recession, 9/11 --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,想起什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of them ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.12,0:28:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉伯之春(反政府运动)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arab spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.58,0:28:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,根本毫不费力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't even break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.01,0:28:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不入虎穴焉得虎子  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got to be in it to win it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.91,0:28:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,混乱引发恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, chaos breeds fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.07,0:28:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧孕育恐慌  恐慌演变成绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear breeds panic, and panic breeds desperation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.68,0:28:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而绝望中总能捞到利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's always profit to be made from desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,引发的混乱有多大  就有多大的残局要收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a big enough mess, has to get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.74,0:28:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干解决麻烦这一行已经一千年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've been in the fix-it business for 1,000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.14,0:28:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在生意正蒸蒸日上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and business has never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不过过去80年里  我们没有了书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for the last 80 years, we haven't had the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.52,0:28:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.44,0:29:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有书在手  我们会所向披靡\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the book, we're unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.10,0:29:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡  怎么了  长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what's going on? Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀的那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl you killed --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.68,0:29:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要拿走她的眼珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}why take her eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.50,0:29:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole situation --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.20,0:29:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.59,0:29:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,采集的时候  我们一般不会留下尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We normally never leave a body when we harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.89,0:29:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的家族特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a family specialty --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.01,0:29:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,生物工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}bioengineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.70,0:29:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,外科增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgical enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.07,0:29:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的可不是隆鼻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not talking about nose jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有两颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hearts in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.64,0:29:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还有额外的肌肉  尤其在腿部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of extra muscle, especially in the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.41,0:29:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,家族的每位成员都有自己的特殊之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man in the family's had a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.33,0:29:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不过也不出意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much what you'd expect, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到我们的先祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}given the family tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Stynes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的先祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real family tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.26,0:29:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,名字做了必要的改动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name was altered out of necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.65,0:30:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你无意中发现了一族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have chanced upon a lineage
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,历史悠久  有光荣传统的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a long and proud tradition...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也有些讨厌的恶名\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some unwanted notoriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是欧洲最古老的家族之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Europe's oldest families.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家族是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house of...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.17,0:30:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.09,0:30:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-让我集中精力  -历史上最伟大的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me focus. - The greatest witches of history
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.27,0:30:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都咨询过我的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}have sought my counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.27,0:30:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意和你合作  你却不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you spurn me when I offer myself as collaborator!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.93,0:30:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god! This is --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.87,0:30:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我没说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I'm making myself clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.69,0:30:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里出状况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a -- I've got a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让查理独自一人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way Charlie can go off by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.89,0:30:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡  很多非常凶恶的人都在找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, there are dangerous people looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.98,0:30:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那我陪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'll go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.96,0:30:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你也不能把罗威娜一个人留在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you -- you can't leave Rowena alone, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.22,0:30:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在毫无进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is getting done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.50,0:30:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把她们分开  小卡  尽力而为吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then separate them, Cass. Just do the best you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankensteins aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只是故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家族也不认识什么玛丽·雪莱(小说作者)\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we never had a family acquaintance named Mary Shelley
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.03,0:30:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她在弗兰肯斯坦城堡待了几晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}who spent a few nights in castle Frankenstein
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.38,0:30:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,无意发现了我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stumbled upon our secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.31,0:31:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,逼得我们只好隐姓埋名\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forced us to change our name and go underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.03,0:31:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那雪莱为什么没把你们的秘密公之于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why didn't Shelley go public?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她都写了本书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wrote a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还要怎么公之于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't get more public than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.98,0:31:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但没人相信那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one believed it to be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.38,0:31:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就像也不会有人相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like no one's gonna believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.70,0:31:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我和我弟弟相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as long as my brother and me believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.75,0:31:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.34,0:31:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.60,0:31:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你们这个小家族挺强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as mighty as I'm sure your little family is,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.73,0:31:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们家族才是世界的主宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}mine is a juggernaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.36,0:31:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not ordinary men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.95,0:31:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是斯巴达式的勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're spartans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.11,0:31:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们并非永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you aren't immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是可牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we are is expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.59,0:31:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒下  还有千千万万的后补兵团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go down, there's an army of replacements behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.01,0:31:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个兵团的大本营在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where does this army call home, hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.16,0:31:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是怪物老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's big daddy Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听我说吗  我们隐姓埋名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you here when I mentioned that we're underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.45,0:31:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.73,0:32:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我特别擅长挖掘秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm swell at uncovering secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.85,0:32:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你把书给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.62,0:32:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就可以聊一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's conceivable that we could have a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.93,0:32:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄  我们没有书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we don't have the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.53,0:32:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,书被烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book was burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.99,0:32:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,书被咒语保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book is protected by a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.91,0:32:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是无法毁灭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.26,0:32:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.43,0:32:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  小卡  我得回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Cass, I got to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.35,0:32:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你解决一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.67,0:32:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会尽快过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.96,0:32:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么事  -解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.86,0:32:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,里面情况如何  有得到什么信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what's going on in there? Get any more out of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  有好多呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, an earful -- truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天  他拧断胳膊逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. He ripped it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.97,0:33:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,独处时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.55,0:33:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她为什么需要独处时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does she need alone time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.66,0:33:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说太自以为是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a prima donna, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.07,0:33:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这姑娘真的不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is simply out of her league.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.69,0:33:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我  会毫无进展的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me, the work grinds to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's under a lot of pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.15,0:33:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且又感觉在背叛朋友  所以更难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it doesn't help that she feels like she's betraying her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:33:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.09,0:33:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她会克服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦她有了自己的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once she has children of her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.48,0:34:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她就会知道什么叫背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'll know all about betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.90,0:34:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.83,0:34:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.74,0:34:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也就地狱之王而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.79,0:34:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳力是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley is your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.73,0:34:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,带他一定很不容易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that was quite a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.82,0:34:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,继续工作吧  我们在这里浪费时间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, back to it, eh? We're wasting time in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看她怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna... see how she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.99,0:34:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(黑鸟旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.53,0:35:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.43,0:35:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意  我可以替你解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can take care of it for you, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.09,0:35:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.05,0:35:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我得解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地址给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有笔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a pencil?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just spill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.03,0:35:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫做黑鸟旅馆的破地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dump called the Blackbird Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.88,0:35:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,登记在卡莉·阿西莫夫名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Registered under the name Carrie Asimov.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有他踪迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.72,0:35:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很多踪迹  但看不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of signs -- just no him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.29,0:35:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟着血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed the blood trail --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,都要流成密西西比河了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, by the way, was like the mississippi --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.49,0:35:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,直到血迹消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}till it ran dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  流血而死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what? He bled out?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.03,0:35:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是踪迹中断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning that the trail stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:35:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了  没啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanished. Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.76,0:35:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定是认为他能打败我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure must have thought he was gonna win that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他可说了不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, phew, was he gabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.85,0:36:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我查阅了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been going through
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.65,0:36:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有关弗兰肯斯坦家族的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we have on the Frankensteins,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.37,0:36:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟埃尔登说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's just like Eldon said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.13,0:36:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一千年令人不快的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, 1,000 years of nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.46,0:36:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们收拾黑死病的烂摊子挣了很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made a ton mopping up the black plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,挑起了百年战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started the 100 years war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.17,0:36:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前想  "斯戴恩家人真多"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I thought, "Man, there's a lot of them Stynes."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.32,0:36:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是猛男中心一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's like, uh, alpha-male central.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.73,0:36:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就想到  这部分是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I thought -- and this is key --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.69,0:36:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想  "这很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, "This is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.62,0:36:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果这些人拿到书  那就糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it would really blow if these guys had the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.82,0:36:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,至少他们没能拿到书"\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they don't have the damn book."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.59,0:36:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,至少那该死的书被烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least the damn book burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.27,0:36:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.47,0:36:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但随后  埃尔登·弗兰肯斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, Eldon Frankenstein --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.00,0:36:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉我一个有趣的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hits me with this little fun fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这书是不能被摧毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that the book can't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.91,0:36:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说这书是不能被切碎  剁碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says that it can't be sliced, diced,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,撕碎  烧毁  淹没的\N{\fnArial\fs30}shredded, burned, drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.39,0:37:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不能被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannot be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.20,0:37:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.04,0:37:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我看到有东西被烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I saw something burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.33,0:37:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  给我接  否则...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you answer that, so help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.13,0:37:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-萨姆  她不见了  -谁不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, she's gone. - Who's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.68,0:37:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我到处找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.34,0:37:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,查理不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.14,0:37:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以西结  7个字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel -- seven letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.13,0:37:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,7代表搜寻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven represents the seeker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(无匹配)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(无匹配)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.03,0:38:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,圣徒代表字母组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saints represent groups of letters
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.54,0:38:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,代表了数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that represent numbers...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.85,0:38:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,代表概念  是由...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that stand for concepts represented by...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(匹配)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.74,0:38:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.67,0:38:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面  阿西莫夫小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in here, Miss Asimov.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.23,0:38:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里有我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have it. I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.29,0:39:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't freakin' believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你又把查理牵扯了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Charlie involved with this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.41,0:39:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在她还失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now she's missing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.68,0:39:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,查理  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.22,0:39:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一个旅馆  黑鸟旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, a -- a motel -- t-t-the Blackbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.94,0:39:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, someone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.91,0:39:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们觉得书在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-t-they think I have the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.43,0:39:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果书在你手里就给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have the book, give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,, 《诅咒之书》在查理那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie has the damn "Book of the Damned"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.25,0:39:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.15,0:39:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我只带着笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- I-I just -- I have my notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.62,0:39:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把笔记给他们  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give them your notes, Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.31,0:39:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把密码给他们  他们想要什么都给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them the code -- whatever they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.67,0:39:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,查理  我不知道到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I don't know what the hell is going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.58,0:39:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you need to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.80,0:39:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁想要什么  你立刻给他们  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give whoever that is whatever they want. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(上传文件)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.07,0:39:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(上传完成)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.65,0:40:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,(发送)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.93,0:40:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,书一直都在你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you had the book the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.23,0:40:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-迪恩  -当着我的面撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean -- - Lied right to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.61,0:40:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这是让你摆脱血印的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was our only chance to get you free of the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.60,0:40:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I grabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.29,0:40:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思我已经说得很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it real clear how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你有考虑过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever consider that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.14,0:40:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还把小卡牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you pulled Cass into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还有查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,查理爱你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie loves you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.05,0:40:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.12,0:40:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把属于我的东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.52,0:40:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,属于我和我家族的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine and my family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.81,0:41:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.49,0:41:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?

